{"v":1,"ts":"2026-08-19T10:54:04Z","actor":"orchestrator","type":"follow_up","id":"fu-tripwire-porcelain-class-not-content","ref_id":"suites-must-not-touch-the-shipping-repo","severity":"P3","finding":"the repo tripwire compares git status --porcelain=v1, which reports a path's change CLASS not its content, so a second write to an already-dirty path is invisible","decision":"on a dirty starting tree a suite can rewrite an already-modified tracked file and read clean; bounded because on a clean checkout the FIRST write is always caught and names the offender","source":"measured 2026-08-19: in a full pre-change census test-aai-doc-numbering read CLEAN only because test-aai-delta-stage2 had already left docs/INDEX.md modified; see SPEC-DRAFT-spec-suites-must-not-touch-the-shipping-repo D7"}
